Rule 15 (Check that the number of embeddings is a positive integer)
{num_embeddings : int} |= num_embeddings > 0
>>
Rule 20 (Shape dimensions should be positive integers)
{input : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(input) - 1] : shape(input, i) > 0
>>
